---
const points = [
  { name: 'A', x: 1, y: 1 },
  { name: 'B', x: 1, y: 2 },
  { name: 'C', x: 2, y: 1 },
  { name: 'D', x: 5, y: 4 },
  { name: 'E', x: 6, y: 5 },
  { name: 'F', x: 5, y: 5 },
];
const centroids = [
  { x: 1, y: 1, nextX: 4 / 3, nextY: 4 / 3 },
  { x: 5, y: 5, nextX: 16 / 3, nextY: 14 / 3 },
];
const x = (value: number) => 42 + value * 48;
const y = (value: number) => 324 - value * 48;
---

<figure>
  <div class="diagram-scroll">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 400 405"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Seis pontos fixos: A(1, 1), B(1, 2), C(2, 1), D(5, 4), E(6, 5) e F(5, 5). Os centroides, desenhados como quadrados, passam de (1, 1) e (5, 5) para (4/3, 4/3) e (16/3, 14/3). Os círculos dos dados não se deslocam."
    >
      <path d="M42 25 V324 H372" fill="none" stroke="var(--text)" />
      <text x="375" y="329">
        x
      </text>
      <text x="25" y="27">
        y
      </text>
      {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6].map((tick) => (
        <g>
          <text x={x(tick)} y="346" text-anchor="middle">
            {tick}
          </text>
          <text x="29" y={y(tick) + 5} text-anchor="end">
            {tick}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
      {centroids.map((centroid) => (
        <g fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2">
          <path
            d={`M${x(centroid.x)} ${y(centroid.y)} L${x(centroid.nextX)} ${y(centroid.nextY)}`}
          />
          <rect
            x={x(centroid.x) - 8}
            y={y(centroid.y) - 8}
            width="16"
            height="16"
            stroke-dasharray="3 2"
          />
          <rect
            x={x(centroid.nextX) - 8}
            y={y(centroid.nextY) - 8}
            width="16"
            height="16"
          />
        </g>
      ))}
      {points.map((point) => (
        <g>
          <circle cx={x(point.x)} cy={y(point.y)} r="4" fill="var(--text)" />
          <text x={x(point.x) - 12} y={y(point.y) - 11} text-anchor="end">
            {point.name}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <g fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2">
        <rect x="42" y="365" width="14" height="14" stroke-dasharray="3 2" />
        <rect x="42" y="389" width="14" height="14" />
      </g>
      <text x="66" y="377">
        Centroides iniciais
      </text>
      <text x="66" y="401">
        Centroides após a média
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Os círculos A a F são dados fixos. Os segmentos ligam cada centroide inicial
    à nova média do seu grupo.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  figure {
    margin-inline: 0;
  }

  .diagram-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font: 19px sans-serif;
  }
</style>
